\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Instability (best-worst Dice gap) vs.\ catastrophic failure rate across four segmenters on MoNuSAC. Each point is a query averaged over 5 seeds and 3 prompt configurations. The negative Pearson correlation and the concentration of points in the upper-left quadrant (low instability, high catastrophic) and lower-right quadrant (high instability, low catastrophic) reveal a structural anti-correlation that holds across all tested segmenters.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
